        customers: ["**Indian vehicle makers**: Maruti, Honda two-wheelers (HMSI), Tata Motors, Ashok Leyland and Mahindra, with new entries at Tata's car business and Hyundai; ₹64cr of new fastener business was won in FY26.", "**The replacement market** through 18 warehouses and 100+ distributors.", "**EV makers** for controllers, chargers and contactors: 33 active programmes and four new confirmations, but its largest EV customer took the work in-house."],
